      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "The guy running to represent Texas wants to dismantle capitalism and bury oil and gas. \n\nWhen he was a state legislator in 2020, Talarico told Austin Sierra Club activists that capitalism works with white supremacy and climate change as 3 oppressive systems America must begin dismantling. \n\nHe said Texas leading in oil and gas was like being the leader in cassette tapes in the 1980s and the industry was not gonna last. Texas produces more than 40% of America’s crude oil, the backbone of the state. \n\nAfter the recording surfaced this year via CNN’s KFile, his campaign calls him a proud capitalist and says the comments missed the mark. \n\nTexans vote November 3. Don’t vote Talarico.",
      "quote": {
        "author": "Rothmus",
        "avatar": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1427434033290661891/hLTTZ5lt_200x200.jpg",
        "created_at_shanghai": "2026-10-24 04:11:05",
        "created_at_utc": "2026-10-23T20:11:05.000Z",
        "id": "2113724913978892430",
        "images": [
          "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113724695061164032/img/X390JcSaoeHm09nU.jpg"
        ],
        "media": [
          {
            "duration": 39.218,
            "height": 1080,
            "thumbnail_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2113724695061164032/img/X390JcSaoeHm09nU.jpg",
            "type": "video",
            "url": "https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2113724695061164032/vid/avc1/1920x1080/BFwyL3OR2fAAe0jc.mp4?tag=29",
            "width": 1920
          }
        ],
        "name": "Rothmus 🏴",
        "text": "James Talarico is a 2021 woke remnant who must lose. \n\nWhen he opposed a transgender athletes bill that year he told the Texas House that God is nonbinary and cited Hebrew grammar for “spirit” in Genesis. \n\nAt the same committee hearing, he claimed modern science recognizes 6 biological sexes before reversing to 2 after Fox pressed him during the campaign. \n\nOn Rogan in 2025, he argued the Bible supports abortion rights because God asked Mary’s consent before the incarnation. \n\nA seminary trained Democrat who spent years pushing those claims has no place winning statewide.",
        "url": "https://x.com/Rothmus/status/2113724913978892430",
        "verified": true,
        "verified_type": "individual"
      },
      "retweet": {
